    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried tylenol earlier but it didnt do much for the ache. i really need something stronger like the advil. i mean, i've taken them together in the past and never felt sick or anything. is there like a safe way to do it? maybe like taking the advil a few hours after the aspirin so they dont hit at once? i just need to get through the night",
